   "body": "cloud/fb-quickwins-sonnet: PR #1132 implements « Vidéos » (Intégrée / Lien) on the existing `embedded_videos` key, kept device-only for now.\n\n- Whether it should sync across devices like « Afficher les signatures » is a product decision: #1148 (`status: needs-decision`).\n- The « no request to a video provider before a tap » criterion is covered by a pure test on the built page (no frame, embed, media element or `src`-like attribute naming a provider, in both modes), not a loopback-session test, because the builder is pure HTML and makes no request (cloud/orch's call). Say if you want the loopback/WebView test anyway.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
